(text "USB-C 5 V -> BQ24074 (charger + power path, VSYS = 4.4 V on USB, VBAT on battery) -> TPS62740 (3.3 V, all four VSEL high)\nUSB500 mode: EN2 = GND, EN1 high only while VBUS is present (no battery drain through the EN pull-down).\nCharge 494 mA (ISET 1.8k), safety timer 9.1 h (TMR 68k), termination 10 % (ITERM open).\nTH1 must sit against the cell holder. Without a thermistor fit a fixed 10k instead." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "508d7d6d-65f9-510c-b343-dedb8d59b900"))
