(text "Cell protection. BAT_N is the cell negative, NOT system GND: the FS8205A sits between them.\nDW01A trips: overcharge 4.30 V, overdischarge 2.40 V (release 3.0 V), overcurrent 150 mV across both FETs (about 2.5 A).\nQ2 blocks a cell inserted backwards. After fitting a cell, plug USB in once to wake the DW01A." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6f351ed-2a42-503f-a8dc-2fda99f77e9f"))
